<title>USA: CorVel &quot;relatively comfortable&quot; with Q2 estimate.</title>
<headline>CorVel &quot;relatively comfortable&quot; with Q2 estimate.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CorVel Corp is &quot;relatively comfortable&quot; with the First Call consensus earnings estimate of $0.45 a share for the fiscal second quarter ending in September, Chairman Gordon Clemons said.</p>
<p>&quot;We're relatively comfortable with that,&quot; Clemons said. CorVel, an independent, nationwide provider of managed care services, earned $0.39 a share in the fiscal 1996 second quarter.</p>
</text>
